BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Sun square Neptune
DESCRIPTION:Transit Sun (Scorpio 10°58’) - square - Natal Neptune \nYou can feel insecure about your direction and sense of life. You may also misunderstand the intentions of others. Beware of embarrassing situations and drugs as a means of escape. Do not make important decisions. \n \nTransit Sun in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit is great for communication and productivity, especially if you earn your living by working with people, writing or doing other creative activities. You will be full of new ideas and positive energy. Relationships with others will improve because of your better ability to communicate. During this transit, the relationships with siblings, extended family and neighbours are important. If you have good relationships with them, you will stay more in touch with them. However, if you do not get on well, there might be a problem.  \nAs far as your social life is concerned, you will be very busy and attend one event after another. Expect a lot of car-related activities - it is the perfect time for a short trip! This transit also brings increased interest in technology and the desire to understand things.  \nHowever, you may also be distracted and unfocused. It is therefore not a good time to take on big tasks or long-term commitments.   \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261103T092700Z
DTEND:20261103T092700Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:13_tr_su_sq_ne
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square IC
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Virgo 2°04’) - square - Natal IC \n \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 1st house: \nThis transit is dominated by emotions!  \nDuring this time, you can be more sensitive than usual, and it will be easier for you to express your emotions. You will be able to feel the energy of your surroundings more than usual. \nIt is a great time to start something new. However, keep in mind that you will tend to make decisions based on your emotions. Therefore, try to be as objective as possible. You will be more moody than usual. Beware of overreacting.  \nYou might take things too personally and you will be very sensitive to criticism.  \nThe sensitivity that this transit brings is reflected in your identity issues - especially what first impression you make on people and how you look. It’s possible that you decide to change how you look. During this period your relationship with your mother and with women in general is very important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261103T120900Z
DTEND:20261103T120900Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
