SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square Venus
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Virgo 14°34’) - square - Natal Venus \nYou may feel vulnerable and insecure. You will want to experience excitement and passion. You should therefore be careful that this mood does not cause a desire for the wrong person or problems in an existing relationship. The home routine will bore you. Avoid manipulating with large sums of money.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 1st house: \nThis transit is dominated by emotions!  \nDuring this time, you can be more sensitive than usual, and it will be easier for you to express your emotions. You will be able to feel the energy of your surroundings more than usual. \nIt is a great time to start something new. However, keep in mind that you will tend to make decisions based on your emotions. Therefore, try to be as objective as possible. You will be more moody than usual. Beware of overreacting.  \nYou might take things too personally and you will be very sensitive to criticism.  \nThe sensitivity that this transit brings is reflected in your identity issues - especially what first impression you make on people and how you look. It’s possible that you decide to change how you look. During this period your relationship with your mother and with women in general is very important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
