BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square Pluto
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Virgo 17°02’) - square - Natal Pluto \nThere is an increased risk of arguments and misunderstandings, especially concerning money issues. You may also decide to make important changes. Sometimes this transit is associated with endings, crises and wasting energy on things that are not worth it. There may also be mild paranoia and suspicion. So, try to look at things objectively and avoid intense emotions.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 1st house: \nThis transit is dominated by emotions!  \nDuring this time, you can be more sensitive than usual, and it will be easier for you to express your emotions. You will be able to feel the energy of your surroundings more than usual. \nIt is a great time to start something new. However, keep in mind that you will tend to make decisions based on your emotions. Therefore, try to be as objective as possible. You will be more moody than usual. Beware of overreacting.  \nYou might take things too personally and you will be very sensitive to criticism.  \nThe sensitivity that this transit brings is reflected in your identity issues - especially what first impression you make on people and how you look. It’s possible that you decide to change how you look. During this period your relationship with your mother and with women in general is very important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261104T150100Z
DTEND:20261104T150100Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:25_tr_mo_sq_pl
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Mercury trine Jupiter
DESCRIPTION:Transit Mercury (Scorpio 12°02’) - trine - Natal Jupiter \nThis transit is favourable for trips, any type of learning and education, writing, and relationships with the public and lawyers. Your mind is overflowing with optimism, and it is easy for other people to work with you. You may be promoted at work or you may receive an interesting offer.  \n \nTransit Mercury in Natal 3rd house: \nYour mind will be bright and quick, and you will find it easy to study and communicate with others. You will be always thinking about something, constantly moving from one topic to another. Therefore, this period is better for solving short-term problems rather than for setting strategic long-term goals.  \nMore frequent traveling or commuting can be expected. This transit can cause problems with transport and technologies. You should also think carefully before signing any contracts or making important decisions. If you can, postpone these things until your mind calms down.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261104T165900Z
DTEND:20261104T165900Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:26_tr_me_tr_ju
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon opposition Moon
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Virgo 24°50’) - opposition - Natal Moon \nWatch out for extreme mood swings! There is also an increased likelihood of quarrels and disputes with your loved ones, especially females, during this transit. You may have more difficulty expressing your emotions.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 1st house: \nThis transit is dominated by emotions!  \nDuring this time, you can be more sensitive than usual, and it will be easier for you to express your emotions. You will be able to feel the energy of your surroundings more than usual. \nIt is a great time to start something new. However, keep in mind that you will tend to make decisions based on your emotions. Therefore, try to be as objective as possible. You will be more moody than usual. Beware of overreacting.  \nYou might take things too personally and you will be very sensitive to criticism.  \nThe sensitivity that this transit brings is reflected in your identity issues - especially what first impression you make on people and how you look. It’s possible that you decide to change how you look. During this period your relationship with your mother and with women in general is very important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261105T051200Z
DTEND:20261105T051200Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:27_tr_mo_op_mo
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Mercury square Neptune
DESCRIPTION:Transit Mercury (Scorpio 10°58’) - square - Natal Neptune \nIt’s hard for you to follow facts and instructions, especially of a technical nature. You will be daydreaming, which will affect your ability to concentrate. It is not a good time to conclude agreements and to give presentations to the public.  \n \nTransit Mercury in Natal 3rd house: \nYour mind will be bright and quick, and you will find it easy to study and communicate with others. You will be always thinking about something, constantly moving from one topic to another. Therefore, this period is better for solving short-term problems rather than for setting strategic long-term goals.  \nMore frequent traveling or commuting can be expected. This transit can cause problems with transport and technologies. You should also think carefully before signing any contracts or making important decisions. If you can, postpone these things until your mind calms down.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261105T124700Z
DTEND:20261105T124700Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:28_tr_me_sq_ne
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine MC
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Libra 2°04’) - trine - Natal MC \n \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 2nd house: \nThis transit shifts your attention to finances.  \nYou will be more concerned about money issues and about things you own. You may tend to derive your own value from material things. Try to keep these issues from affecting you and not do not compare your financial situation with others. However, it is a good time to think about what to do for greater material security.  \nDuring this period your way of thinking will be rather conservative and pragmatic, and you will not be interested in exciting experiences. Beware of impulsive spending, which you might later regret!  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261105T182700Z
DTEND:20261105T182700Z
