BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine Venus
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Libra 14°34’) - trine - Natal Venus \nIf you need to talk to someone about your feelings, now is the perfect time! You will be focusing on your family and sharing experiences with your loved ones. You will also be able to successfully communicate at work and you will do extremely well if you must speak in public.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 2nd house: \nThis transit shifts your attention to finances.  \nYou will be more concerned about money issues and about things you own. You may tend to derive your own value from material things. Try to keep these issues from affecting you and not do not compare your financial situation with others. However, it is a good time to think about what to do for greater material security.  \nDuring this period your way of thinking will be rather conservative and pragmatic, and you will not be interested in exciting experiences. Beware of impulsive spending, which you might later regret!  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
