BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon opposition Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Scorpio 16°59’) - opposition - Natal Sun \nThe harmony between the male and female elements is missing in your life. This may manifest itself in the inability to balance material and emotional aspects of your life. There may also be a problem with the opposite sex. Try not to overreact and use this dynamic energy to identify problems and find harmony.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit won’t let you rest!  \nGet ready for short trips, lots of errands and lots of communication, especially on the phone. You’ll be more extroverted than usual, and you will want to stand out. \nYour thoughts will be rather distracted, but on the other hand, you will think unusually sharply. You will also be able to communicate your ideas well. You will be able to make new acquaintances or even new friends easily. On the other hand, thanks to the increased energy and desire to plunge into everything with vigour, you may have difficulties concentrating and be less receptive to what others are trying to tell you.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261109T071400Z
DTEND:20261109T071400Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:43_tr_mo_op_su
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Sun opposition Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Sun (Scorpio 16°59’) - opposition - Natal Sun \nExpect obstacles in your endeavours. Take these challenges as an opportunity to learn. Pay more attention to your body because you may feel apathetic and sick; you may even injure yourself.  \n \nTransit Sun in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit is great for communication and productivity, especially if you earn your living by working with people, writing or doing other creative activities. You will be full of new ideas and positive energy. Relationships with others will improve because of your better ability to communicate. During this transit, the relationships with siblings, extended family and neighbours are important. If you have good relationships with them, you will stay more in touch with them. However, if you do not get on well, there might be a problem.  \nAs far as your social life is concerned, you will be very busy and attend one event after another. Expect a lot of car-related activities - it is the perfect time for a short trip! This transit also brings increased interest in technology and the desire to understand things.  \nHowever, you may also be distracted and unfocused. It is therefore not a good time to take on big tasks or long-term commitments.   \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261109T092500Z
DTEND:20261109T092500Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:44_tr_su_op_su
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine Moon
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Scorpio 24°50’) - trine - Natal Moon \nThis transit brings emotional stability, a sense of satisfaction and a good mood. Your intuition will be great. You will be very popular, so it’s a good time to make new acquaintances and friends. There will not be any problems related to financial and family matters. This transit is great for investments, property and business matters.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit won’t let you rest!  \nGet ready for short trips, lots of errands and lots of communication, especially on the phone. You’ll be more extroverted than usual, and you will want to stand out. \nYour thoughts will be rather distracted, but on the other hand, you will think unusually sharply. You will also be able to communicate your ideas well. You will be able to make new acquaintances or even new friends easily. On the other hand, thanks to the increased energy and desire to plunge into everything with vigour, you may have difficulties concentrating and be less receptive to what others are trying to tell you.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
