BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon opposition Mercury
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Sagittarius 7°17’) - opposition - Natal Mercury \nBe careful about misunderstandings, especially at home. It will be more challenging for you to maintain objectivity and to keep to the facts, so it is not a good time to compromise and negotiate. You may also experience small problems, especially with electronics and vehicles (for example, your car may break down, you may miss a bus, your computer may break, etc.). This transit is good for communication in your relationships.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 4th house: \nNow is the ideal time for family affairs and to spend time in the comfort of your home or with your relatives.  \nBetween the four walls of your own home you will feel the best because you will have a greater desire for privacy than usual. It is also an ideal time to make your home more beautiful. You will tend to focus more on family and personal affairs and relationships, especially with your loved ones. In these relationships you will show more empathy and understanding. Your mood will be influenced especially by how safe you feel in your personal life.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
