SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Aquarius 16°59’) - square - Natal Sun \nYou may get stressed and agitated. You may also deal with problems without thinking first. During this short period of time there is a risk that you will not be as popular as usual. Try not to take it too personally. It is advisable to avoid any changes and starting new things. There may also be unexpected changes to your routine.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 6th house: \nThis transit emphasizes the importance of work, health and habits.  \nYou will be systematic and organized when you are doing your everyday activities. It is an ideal time for big cleaning and organising your wardrobe and documents. You will also be more emotional about work-related issues. You may be more moody than usual, take your business matters too personally, or, on the other hand, you may put aside your emotions and concentrate too much on your work. You can also overreact to criticism from your supervisor or colleagues, whether the criticism is constructive or not. Beware of the tendency to become too stressed by work issues, it can exhaust you emotionally. There is also a higher risk of stress affecting your health, mainly in the form of pain in different parts of the body. Try to make your work as comfortable as possible and focus on beneficial routine activities such as meditation or yoga. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261116T193800Z
DTEND:20261116T193800Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:73_tr_mo_sq_su
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon sextile Pluto
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Aquarius 17°02’) - sextile - Natal Pluto \nDuring this transit you will feel everything intensely and deeply. You will think about the meaning of life and mysteries. You may also be able to successfully read between the lines.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 6th house: \nThis transit emphasizes the importance of work, health and habits.  \nYou will be systematic and organized when you are doing your everyday activities. It is an ideal time for big cleaning and organising your wardrobe and documents. You will also be more emotional about work-related issues. You may be more moody than usual, take your business matters too personally, or, on the other hand, you may put aside your emotions and concentrate too much on your work. You can also overreact to criticism from your supervisor or colleagues, whether the criticism is constructive or not. Beware of the tendency to become too stressed by work issues, it can exhaust you emotionally. There is also a higher risk of stress affecting your health, mainly in the form of pain in different parts of the body. Try to make your work as comfortable as possible and focus on beneficial routine activities such as meditation or yoga. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261116T194500Z
DTEND:20261116T194500Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:74_tr_mo_se_pl
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Sun trine Moon
DESCRIPTION:Transit Sun (Scorpio 24°50’) - trine - Natal Moon \nYou feel strong and your energy is at its peak. It is now a good time to finish whatever is needed. Expect harmony and improvement in relationships, especially with the opposite sex. You can also maintain a better balance between your personal and work life.  \n \nTransit Sun in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit is great for communication and productivity, especially if you earn your living by working with people, writing or doing other creative activities. You will be full of new ideas and positive energy. Relationships with others will improve because of your better ability to communicate. During this transit, the relationships with siblings, extended family and neighbours are important. If you have good relationships with them, you will stay more in touch with them. However, if you do not get on well, there might be a problem.  \nAs far as your social life is concerned, you will be very busy and attend one event after another. Expect a lot of car-related activities - it is the perfect time for a short trip! This transit also brings increased interest in technology and the desire to understand things.  \nHowever, you may also be distracted and unfocused. It is therefore not a good time to take on big tasks or long-term commitments.   \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261117T044100Z
DTEND:20261117T044100Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:75_tr_su_tr_mo
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Mercury sextile Ascendant
DESCRIPTION:Transit Mercury (Scorpio 6°12’) - sextile - Natal Ascendant \n \n \nTransit Mercury in Natal 3rd house: \nYour mind will be bright and quick, and you will find it easy to study and communicate with others. You will be always thinking about something, constantly moving from one topic to another. Therefore, this period is better for solving short-term problems rather than for setting strategic long-term goals.  \nMore frequent traveling or commuting can be expected. This transit can cause problems with transport and technologies. You should also think carefully before signing any contracts or making important decisions. If you can, postpone these things until your mind calms down.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261117T082700Z
DTEND:20261117T082700Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:76_tr_me_se_as
END:VEVENT
