BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon sextile Mercury
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Aries 7°17’) - sextile - Natal Mercury \nYou will feel satisfied with your life. Any tension in relationships is likely to disappear and you will be able to focus on maintaining peace. You will also benefit from a walk in a place where you feel relaxed and comfortable. Communication with others, studying and developing new ideas will make you happy. This transit is good for negotiating, establishing new business contacts and executing transactions.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 8th house: \nThis transit brings the desire to explore things in depth.  \nYou will not have the need to be very social and you may despise having shallow conversations. You will seek strong experiences and have the desire for deeper relationships. You may try to analyse everything and think about the meaning of life. You will tend to do research, solve problems and mysteries. You may be interested in astrology, occult sciences, or you may be in the mood to watch a horror movie.  \nBeware of exaggerated, biased reactions, and especially fluctuations in moods. Be careful about your sexuality and intimate relationships, as you will be very sensitive about these issues.  \nEmotional reactions associated with inheritance may appear. If you have inherited something, you may start thinking more about it or emotionally cope with it. Shared resources with your mother or other women are also important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261120T185700Z
DTEND:20261120T185700Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:93_tr_mo_se_me
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Sun square Uranus
DESCRIPTION:Transit Sun (Scorpio 28°33’) - square - Natal Uranus \nExpect surprises and unexpected changes in your plans. You may also choose to change your direction. Your superiors may behave illogically. You may be nervous and restless. There is a risk of injury.  \n \nTransit Sun in Natal 3rd house: \nThis transit is great for communication and productivity, especially if you earn your living by working with people, writing or doing other creative activities. You will be full of new ideas and positive energy. Relationships with others will improve because of your better ability to communicate. During this transit, the relationships with siblings, extended family and neighbours are important. If you have good relationships with them, you will stay more in touch with them. However, if you do not get on well, there might be a problem.  \nAs far as your social life is concerned, you will be very busy and attend one event after another. Expect a lot of car-related activities - it is the perfect time for a short trip! This transit also brings increased interest in technology and the desire to understand things.  \nHowever, you may also be distracted and unfocused. It is therefore not a good time to take on big tasks or long-term commitments.   \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261120T210300Z
DTEND:20261120T210300Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:94_tr_su_sq_ur
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon sextile Neptune
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Aries 10°58’) - sextile - Natal Neptune \nDuring this transit you will be absorbed by the world of fantasy and imagination. This can be great especially if you make a living by doing creative activities. You are more receptive to the needs of others, so your relationships are going well.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 8th house: \nThis transit brings the desire to explore things in depth.  \nYou will not have the need to be very social and you may despise having shallow conversations. You will seek strong experiences and have the desire for deeper relationships. You may try to analyse everything and think about the meaning of life. You will tend to do research, solve problems and mysteries. You may be interested in astrology, occult sciences, or you may be in the mood to watch a horror movie.  \nBeware of exaggerated, biased reactions, and especially fluctuations in moods. Be careful about your sexuality and intimate relationships, as you will be very sensitive about these issues.  \nEmotional reactions associated with inheritance may appear. If you have inherited something, you may start thinking more about it or emotionally cope with it. Shared resources with your mother or other women are also important.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
