BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Mars opposition Uranus
DESCRIPTION:Transit Mars (Leo 28°33’) - opposition - Natal Uranus \nYou will lack patience and feel restless. You may get into explosive arguments and rebel against conventions. You may encounter problems with technology and electrical devices.  \n \nTransit Mars in Natal 12th house: \nYour subconscious motives and the psychological causes of your actions will resurface. You may experience moments of frustration, but if you learn to work with this energy, it can help you to understand and solve your problems. However, you may also be irritated and have no idea why you are acting according to patterns of behaviour learned in the past, even on a subconscious level. This transit gives you the ideal opportunity to work with these patterns and break them.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261122T104200Z
DTEND:20261122T104200Z
