BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Sun opposition MC
DESCRIPTION:Transit Sun (Sagittarius 2°04’) - opposition - Natal MC \n \n \nTransit Sun in Natal 4th house: \nNow is the perfect time to stay at home and with your family!  \nYou will feel the desire to make your home more comfortable, plunge yourself into long-delayed repairs or you may decide to renovate your house. Since this transit also indicates a good time to deal with real estate, you might start thinking about moving, or even buying a house or an apartment. At this time, your home will serve as a comfortable place where you can hide from the outside world. \nFamily is inherently connected with home. During this transit you may want to spend more time with your family than usual. Especially important is the relationship with your mother, who may need your attention. You will also start thinking more about what stable family environment should feel like and may even decide to search for your family roots. This transit also encourages you to think about securing yourself financially for retirement.  \n \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261124T083900Z
DTEND:20261124T083900Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:111_tr_su_op_mc
END:VEVENT
