BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon conjunction Mercury
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Gemini 7°17’) - conjunction - Natal Mercury \nBeware of biased decision making and procrastination. Your emotions can change very quickly, and the excessive imagination that this transit brings may not always be beneficial. It is a good time for conversations with others, inventing, new ideas and sharing. You are very intellectually receptive, but your mind may be restless. It is also a good time to ask for advice or consultation.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 10th house: \nYour reputation, especially in relation to authorities, will be important to you during this transit. \nYou will feel the desire for recognition and appreciation of your efforts. If you do not feel well respected, you may want to require others to respect you more; you may especially need the respect of your superiors. The relationship with your father will be important during this time, especially how much you feel respected by him. You may also be sensitive about your social status, you may for example overreact if someone makes a note about how much you earn.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261124T224700Z
DTEND:20261124T224700Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:118_tr_mo_co_me
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine Neptune
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Gemini 10°58’) - trine - Natal Neptune \nDuring this transit you will be absorbed by the world of fantasy and imagination. This can be great especially if you make a living by doing creative activities. You are more receptive to the needs of others, so your relationships are going well.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 10th house: \nYour reputation, especially in relation to authorities, will be important to you during this transit. \nYou will feel the desire for recognition and appreciation of your efforts. If you do not feel well respected, you may want to require others to respect you more; you may especially need the respect of your superiors. The relationship with your father will be important during this time, especially how much you feel respected by him. You may also be sensitive about your social status, you may for example overreact if someone makes a note about how much you earn.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
