BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square Moon
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Gemini 24°50’) - square - Natal Moon \nYou will have to deal with unexpected changes in your schedule. Avoid being overly temperamental and indecisive, because it can lower your popularity and cause bad business decisions. You may feel lonely and stressed out. Therefore, it is not a good time for any new beginnings.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 10th house: \nYour reputation, especially in relation to authorities, will be important to you during this transit. \nYou will feel the desire for recognition and appreciation of your efforts. If you do not feel well respected, you may want to require others to respect you more; you may especially need the respect of your superiors. The relationship with your father will be important during this time, especially how much you feel respected by him. You may also be sensitive about your social status, you may for example overreact if someone makes a note about how much you earn.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
