BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine DSC
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Cancer 6°12’) - trine - Natal DSC \n \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 11th house: \nThis transit affects relationships with friends.  \nYou will feel a strong desire to spend time with friends and acquaintances. However, you may be hypersensitive and get insulted if they say something that feels inappropriate. You will get easily offended when people criticise you. You will also be more responsive than usual to the moods of other people.  \nAnother area which this transit influences is your personal goals and desires. Emotional charge will be present when you participate in humanitarian activities. You may want to help others. Your thinking will be progressive. You may want to do new things, and nothing will stop you from doing them. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
