BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Mercury opposition Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Mercury (Scorpio 16°59’) - opposition - Natal Sun \nYour daily schedule will be overloaded. You will be so overwhelmed that it will be difficult for you to be yourself and to express your needs. On the other hand, you can meet a lot of new people. You should try to be a good listener and you should not reject opinions that are different from your own. You will be inclined to do so during this transit, which can lead to quarrels. You should also avoid confrontations with superiors. You need to find time to relax, otherwise you may be too tense and suffer from headaches.  \n \nTransit Mercury in Natal 3rd house: \nYour mind will be bright and quick, and you will find it easy to study and communicate with others. You will be always thinking about something, constantly moving from one topic to another. Therefore, this period is better for solving short-term problems rather than for setting strategic long-term goals.  \nMore frequent traveling or commuting can be expected. This transit can cause problems with transport and technologies. You should also think carefully before signing any contracts or making important decisions. If you can, postpone these things until your mind calms down.  \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261127T100200Z
DTEND:20261127T100200Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:129_tr_me_op_su
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon sextile Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Cancer 16°59’) - sextile - Natal Sun \nYou will have a sense of life and there is harmony between your soul and your body. It is now easy for you to cooperate with others and maintain good relationships, mainly because you’re more open and honest with others. If this transit occurs at night, you will sleep well.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 11th house: \nThis transit affects relationships with friends.  \nYou will feel a strong desire to spend time with friends and acquaintances. However, you may be hypersensitive and get insulted if they say something that feels inappropriate. You will get easily offended when people criticise you. You will also be more responsive than usual to the moods of other people.  \nAnother area which this transit influences is your personal goals and desires. Emotional charge will be present when you participate in humanitarian activities. You may want to help others. Your thinking will be progressive. You may want to do new things, and nothing will stop you from doing them. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261127T140600Z
DTEND:20261127T140600Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:130_tr_mo_se_su
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine Moon
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Cancer 24°51’) - trine - Natal Moon \nThis transit brings emotional stability, a sense of satisfaction and a good mood. Your intuition will be great. You will be very popular, so it’s a good time to make new acquaintances and friends. There will not be any problems related to financial and family matters. This transit is great for investments, property and business matters.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 11th house: \nThis transit affects relationships with friends.  \nYou will feel a strong desire to spend time with friends and acquaintances. However, you may be hypersensitive and get insulted if they say something that feels inappropriate. You will get easily offended when people criticise you. You will also be more responsive than usual to the moods of other people.  \nAnother area which this transit influences is your personal goals and desires. Emotional charge will be present when you participate in humanitarian activities. You may want to help others. Your thinking will be progressive. You may want to do new things, and nothing will stop you from doing them. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
