BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon sextile Mars
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Leo 16°14’) - sextile - Natal Mars \nYou will feel happy with yourself and overflow with healthy self-esteem. Your desires and emotions will be in complete harmony, and you will use your impulses and passions for achieving positive results. Relationships with others will be marked by honesty and appreciation of the real You. You will also be more independent and willing to take initiative.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 12th house: \nYou will feel the desire to isolate yourself from the outside world and connect with your inner self. Your will have good intuition, but you may suppress your emotions. You will be tired, insecure and you will not want to plunge into anything new. It is therefore an ideal time to relax. It is also possible that you will discover that you have enemies, whom you did not know you had. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261129T143100Z
DTEND:20261129T143100Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T191801Z
UID:141_tr_mo_se_ma
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tr. Moon square Sun
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Leo 16°59’) - square - Natal Sun \nYou may get stressed and agitated. You may also deal with problems without thinking first. During this short period of time there is a risk that you will not be as popular as usual. Try not to take it too personally. It is advisable to avoid any changes and starting new things. There may also be unexpected changes to your routine.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 12th house: \nYou will feel the desire to isolate yourself from the outside world and connect with your inner self. Your will have good intuition, but you may suppress your emotions. You will be tired, insecure and you will not want to plunge into anything new. It is therefore an ideal time to relax. It is also possible that you will discover that you have enemies, whom you did not know you had. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
DTSTART:20261129T154800Z
DTEND:20261129T154800Z
