SUMMARY:Tr. Moon trine Pluto
DESCRIPTION:Transit Moon (Leo 17°03’) - trine - Natal Pluto \nDuring this transit you will feel everything intensely and deeply. You will think about the meaning of life and mysteries. You may also be able to successfully read between the lines.  \n \nTransit Moon in Natal 12th house: \nYou will feel the desire to isolate yourself from the outside world and connect with your inner self. Your will have good intuition, but you may suppress your emotions. You will be tired, insecure and you will not want to plunge into anything new. It is therefore an ideal time to relax. It is also possible that you will discover that you have enemies, whom you did not know you had. \n \nPersonal Transit Calendar:  \nhttps://horoscopes.astro-seek.com/personal-transit-calendar-monthly-astrology-transits
